        "product_summary": "Knit lace-up walking shoes with a low collar and two-tone upper panels. The color-blocked toe and heel areas give the style a sporty casual appearance. Traditional laces let the wearer adjust the upper rather than rely only on a fixed shoe opening.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
